Hephaestus — hard sciences and productive work (@hephaestus: 0, is #chapter, #making-and-maintenance "inquiry/Inquiry.lingua#r_75MNKZQKNB0XBG021SWWW2HASB", #making-and-maintenance "engineering/Engineering.lingua#r_5DA6VY09MAD2N8D9SH0FFJVV68", #making-and-maintenance "materials/Materials.lingua#r_14HP6K610XB12E2WGNK9A6VN8D", #making-and-maintenance "utilities/Utilities.lingua#r_23Z5YYXGRA1JDFD4BAM955JMNX", #hephaestus "inquiry/Inquiry.lingua#r_75MNKZQKNB0XBG021SWWW2HASB", #hephaestus "chemistry/Chemistry.lingua#r_2NWJY1HCKPBM4T6YQSDHN8S3S0", #hephaestus "engineering/Engineering.lingua#r_5DA6VY09MAD2N8D9SH0FFJVV68", #hephaestus "physics/Physics.lingua#r_04A5CP8RTBERZEN4XCCDQ3T47W", #part-of "../Ergon.lingua#r_FE78A5A2D2A3261F711703DCC1", #hephaestus "materials/Materials.lingua#r_14HP6K610XB12E2WGNK9A6VN8D", #hephaestus "utilities/Utilities.lingua#r_23Z5YYXGRA1JDFD4BAM955JMNX", #hephaestus "production/Production.lingua#r_2Y7YR9YHGPS7CWXQ7R4SAJVBR4", #making-and-maintenance "production/Production.lingua#r_2Y7YR9YHGPS7CWXQ7R4SAJVBR4") { r_00000000000000000000002001
Within [Ergon — useful labor and productive knowledge](../Ergon.lingua#r_FE78A5A2D2A3261F711703DCC1), Hephaestus connects mathematics, hard sciences, engineering, computing and productive infrastructure. Pure theory belongs here as fully as its applications. [Gaia](../gaia/Nature.lingua#r_5DAMNRQZX9M2PRPHVJB673XX21) supplies connected Earth, life, food and health knowledge.

Choose an existing entrance and follow the question that interests you:

- [Inquiry](inquiry/Inquiry.lingua#r_75MNKZQKNB0XBG021SWWW2HASB): quantitative literacy, measurement and reproducible computation.
- [Physics](physics/Physics.lingua#r_04A5CP8RTBERZEN4XCCDQ3T47W): electromagnetism, thermodynamics, heat transfer and fluid dynamics.
- [Chemistry](chemistry/Chemistry.lingua#r_2NWJY1HCKPBM4T6YQSDHN8S3S0): general and industrial chemistry.
- [Engineering](engineering/Engineering.lingua#r_5DA6VY09MAD2N8D9SH0FFJVV68): mining/mineral engineering, electrical power engineering and mechanical engineering, from foundations through machine design, construction, measurement, continuing service and independent research. Materials engineering develops observations and structure, equilibrium and kinetics, material families, mechanical/functional behavior, fabrication/state control, degradation, selection, service, recovery and life-cycle comparisons. Multiscale models, measurement inference, integrated process-to-service investigations and independent research deepen the full materials formation.
- [Resources and materials](materials/Materials.lingua#r_14HP6K610XB12E2WGNK9A6VN8D): metallurgical production and chemical feedstock/supply systems.
- [Utilities](utilities/Utilities.lingua#r_23Z5YYXGRA1JDFD4BAM955JMNX): water and sanitation, from sources through treatment, distribution, wastewater, industrial reuse and continuing service. Industrial gases and vacuum develop production, purity, pumps, surfaces, delivery, measurement, operation and recovery through independent research.
- [Production and quality](production/Production.lingua#r_2Y7YR9YHGPS7CWXQ7R4SAJVBR4): clean manufacturing, from useful function and unwanted material to sampling, measurement, particle transport and collection, adhesion, wetting, surface storage, contamination chemistry, cleaning, rinsing and preservation. Facility material develops layout, airflow, filtration, pressure, transfers, utilities and control. Aerosol measurement connects sampling, instrument response, calibration and inference. Surface measurement, qualification and monitoring connect imaging, chemical evidence, operating domains, acceptance sampling and change detection. Inspectable calculations and twenty-four investigations connect the concepts. Manufacturing and continuing-service studies remain in development, with a sensitive-data TODO recorded for specialist microbial laboratory methods.

For an existing introduction to circuits, controllers and connected devices, read [Basic electronics](computer-science/Basic%20Eletronics.lingua). [Reproducible computational work](inquiry/reproducible-computation/Reproducible-computation.lingua#r_78FWWJDCV0ZGG7VYSPRCWN56DQ) provides a connected programming and investigation foundation. The wider computing subjects remain in the development register.

Follow materials, energy, equipment, information, skills, transport and maintenance across these branches. Reuse specific Records as their ideas become useful; a connection does not require completing every neighbouring subject. Questions about explanation, evidence and purpose return to [Philosophy](../../scholazein/philosophy/Philosophy.lingua#r_00000000000000000000001001).

[Hephaestus development register](../../lince/Trails.lingua#r_B6CB9BDC51A6B67584422A89AE) contains the full remaining scope, including mathematics, space, computing, production, logistics and facilities. Subject directories belong beneath their field homes. Books, articles, software and media are referenced through their sources.

} r_00000000000000000000002001

